# Coverage requirements

- All TypeScript packages under `packages/` must maintain **≥80%** unit test coverage (lines, statements, functions, branches).
- Run `pnpm test:coverage` from the repo root before finishing TypeScript changes.
- Do not lower thresholds or exclude production modules to pass the gate.
- Prefer injectable command runners and temp-dir fixtures over skipping hard-to-test code.
- New packages must ship with `test` and `test:coverage` scripts using the shared `.c8rc.json`.
